WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Start at the tank. It holds the water for this row.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Water leaves the tank. The filter catches grit.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Follow the water inside the drip line beside the plants.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Under the mulch, water leaves the dripper one drop at a time.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Each drop soaks into the soil. Watch the damp patch spread around the roots.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:42.000
From the tank, through the line, to the roots. The path stays dry.
